{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 10.32, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "老娘首复盘 S 四十三最后定榜一千一百九十。哎，好可惜，差一点定榜千抢嘛，确实有点可惜了。那今天就不", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000000", "start_sec": 0.32, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 20.36, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "锐评了吧。什么？你说的千一百九十是巅峰分啊，你是要气死老娘吗？我还以为是全国排名呢。那你今天看老娘锐不锐评你的。来到线上，安琪", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000001", "start_sec": 10.32, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 30.4, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "拉对线大部分中单法师都是有线权的，很不巧，这把对线的是小部分中单，打嫦娥线权不好拿。再来看你这神奇宝贝操作，走到", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000002", "start_sec": 20.36, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 40.48, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "嫦娥二技能里面去吃伤害，然后抢线也出现失误了。正常两个一技能就能清完线的，你三个一技能才清完，等吃完兵线自己被打成一丝血了，往下路", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000003", "start_sec": 30.4, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 50.6, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "跑是吧，你往野草跑呀，傻了吧唧的跑到发育路给对面伽罗送了个人头。你别说，这安琪拉还挺贴心的，还有送货上门服务。好", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000004", "start_sec": 40.48, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 60.76, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "在后续对面嫦娥回终的时候，你们家打野在河道收掉了，止了一下损。复活出来，这个时候来看啊，你这波是不是可以顺手丢个一技能帮打", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000005", "start_sec": 50.6, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
