{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 81.0, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "让打野更快刷完野区，何乐而不为呢？来看这一波就做的挺好的嘛。去上路支援的途中，顺手丢个一技能给蓝Buff，帮打野速刷一下。不过你来对抗路的意义是什", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000007", "start_sec": 70.84, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
