{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 182.24, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "二次。这波清完线给个向上走的视野，再悄悄绕回中路右草。你们看，这就是为什么要给假视野，敌人完全不知道你在这个草丛。这波我相信你", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000017", "start_sec": 172.16, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 192.299, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "以安琪拉的爆发可以蹲死嫦娥的。结果呢，二一三技能又分头行动，一技能又丢歪了，你这到底要干嘛呀？没蹲到人就算了，自己交个", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000018", "start_sec": 182.24, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 202.32, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "闪现还没跑掉。五分钟战绩来到豪华的零杠五。再次复活出来，傻人有傻福啊，捡到一个人头。接着看，都给李白秒了，你就", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000019", "start_sec": 192.3, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
