{"backend": "manus-speech-to-text", "canonical": true, "confidence": null, "end_sec": 222.92, "language": "zho", "raw_text": "亡数量依旧是在跟时间赛跑。第六次复活出来已经有点神志不清了，想直勾勾地走到对面脸上去打一套，根本不给机会，还白白吃到", "representation": "source_transcript", "seed_id": "hokclass_007", "source_artifact": "/home/ubuntu/hokcoach/data/evaluation/replay_seeds/corpus/videos/hokclass_007/evidence/stt/hokclass_007_transcription.json", "speech_segment_id": "hokclass_007_stt_000021", "start_sec": 212.9, "timestamp_basis": "audio_playback_time", "video_id": "Tq5eD3ECpyw"}
